          {
            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "The CILSNL is a continuation of the Dutch part of the data collected in the Children of Immigrant Longitudinal Survey in Four European Countries (CILS4EU) (Kalter et al., 2016a, 2016b, 2016c). Hence, the sample of the CILS4EU is the source of the sample for the CILSNL.\n\nKalter, Frank, Anthony F. Heath, Miles Hewstone, Jan O. Jonsson, Matthijs Kalmijn, Irena Kogan, and Frank van Tubergen. 2016a. Children of Immigrants Longitudinal Survey in Four European Countries (CILS4EU) – Full version. Data file for on‐site use. GESIS Data Archive, Cologne, ZA5353 Data file Version 1.2.0, doi:10.4232/cils4eu.5353.1.2.0.\n\nKalter, Frank, Anthony F. Heath, Miles Hewstone, Jan O. Jonsson, Matthijs Kalmijn, Irena Kogan, and Frank van Tubergen. 2016b. Children of Immigrants Longitudinal Survey in Four European Countries (CILS4EU) – Full version. Data file for on‐site use. GESIS Data Archive, Cologne, ZA5353 Data file Version 2.3.0, doi:10.4232/cils4eu.5353.2.3.0.\n\nKalter, Frank, Anthony F. Heath, Miles Hewstone, Jan O. Jonsson, Matthijs Kalmijn, Irena Kogan, and Frank van Tubergen. 2016c. Children of Immigrants Longitudinal Survey in Four European Countries (CILS4EU) – Full version. Data file for on‐site use. GESIS Data Archive, Cologne, ZA5353 Data file Version 3.1.0, doi:10.4232/cils4eu.5353.3.1.0."
            ]
          }
